/P 88 0 R
/E (I believe art to be a very effective way to express and convey ideas and emotions.  Certain types of art such as fine art \(paintings, sculptures, and digital art\), music and film are, in my personal experience, are the strongest in terms of impact and richness.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
