184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (A simple music video accompanied by a song that fits right can make you burst into tears, while a whole movie that was meant to do the same, couldn't do it. There are also instances where you may hear a song and then feel that it would fit just right to accompany a specific event, video or activity. For example, a song that you may refer to as a wedding song may never have been tagged as anything of the sort by the creator. Sometimes even the beat of a song may bring a person to think of it as a wedding song even though the piece may be new or perhaps never been used at weddings.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
