/E (A male figure with a hollow chest, the only thing to support his head is his physical structure. By no means is he spineless, despite the beating he has taken. An analytical  mind that is guided by his self-made mindset and thought process. Calloused knees suggest that falling prostrate, weather to the wight of his own thoughts or foreign factors,  is not a rare  occurrence. The hardened texture of his skin cracks when he moves, causing pain and discomfort. His face has become devoid of human softness. He in a constant search for anything that may change his life, something to fill his emptiness. This search can often be very straining, as can be seen exerted on his forearm. His back-foot has been cut at the Achilles tendon leaving him unable to walk or move without great effort and pain. His shin bone has become thin and fragile after his constant confused effort to fix his condition. His efforts are in vain because he knows not how to help himself in certain situations. . The other foot steadily placed on the ground with a heavy anklet that keeps him grounded. The anklet is his belief, faith and his sense of existence. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
