<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (Some of life's most important questions are answered  with the understanding of how to balance things. Knowing where to draw the line with everything is usually the most important piece of wisdom a person can have. In my 20 years of being alive I would think I grew up relatively fast, forcing myself to learn about people and the meanings of all sorts of things pretty early on in life. From a third persons perspective a life such as mine would look mundane, polished and easy going. As i grew up, met and spoke to countless more people; i started to learn how people are with problems. Everyone has their fair share of hurdles in life. Some individuals are better equipped for any specific problem than others, who in turn may be worse off with some other problems. Life gets "tough" when your combination of problems is just the type that you may not be the best at dealing with. )
/E (Some of life's most important questions are answered  with the understanding of how to balance things. Knowing where to draw the line with everything is usually the most important piece of wisdom a person can have. In my 20 years of being alive I would think I grew up relatively fast, forcing myself to learn about people and the meanings of all sorts of things pretty early on in life. From a third persons perspective a life such as mine would look mundane, polished and easy going. As i grew up, met and spoke to countless more people; i started to learn how people are with problems. Everyone has their fair share of hurdles in life. Some individuals are better equipped for any specific problem than others, who in turn may be worse off with some other problems. Life gets "tough" when your combination of problems is just the type that you may not be the best at dealing with. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
