282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (Lets take for example, a teenager with a broken family  who doesn't see the importance in his parents relationship with each other as long as they treat him well. This boy may, in turn, be horribly affected by negative thoughts about his career or friends. Another teenager exists somewhere in the world that has the right mindset and power through hurdles that show up while he builds his career but cant bear the thought of committing to other things while his family remains dysfunctional.  Now imagine this type of thing but with multiple problems in each teenagers life, although unfortunately, 4 out of 6 problems for example are ones that that specific individual cant handle. He's being hammered because he just cant balance between problems and cant balance priorities.  In my personal experience, this balance is the one between order and chaos. The Yin and Yang of life. )
/E (Lets take for example, a teenager with a broken family  who doesn't see the importance in his parents relationship with each other as long as they treat him well. This boy may, in turn, be horribly affected by negative thoughts about his career or friends. Another teenager exists somewhere in the world that has the right mindset and power through hurdles that show up while he builds his career but cant bear the thought of committing to other things while his family remains dysfunctional.  Now imagine this type of thing but with multiple problems in each teenagers life, although unfortunately, 4 out of 6 problems for example are ones that that specific individual cant handle. He's being hammered because he just cant balance between problems and cant balance priorities.  In my personal experience, this balance is the one between order and chaos. The Yin and Yang of life. )
