/Title (For the entirely different reasons, people seem to dislike art: it just doesn't look very nice; it's not worth a pretty penny; or someone has already told them that is not very good It is also quite easy to compare artworks, and detest one that is based on your thoughts about the piece hung right next to it on the wall.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1225 0 R
>>
